```

In `src/components/PDFView/index.tsx`, the `PressableWithoutFeedback` component is given `accessibilityRole={CONST.ROLE.BUTTON}`. This role does not match `CONST.ROLE.PRESENTATION`, so the `cursorStyle` will default to `styles.cursorPointer`.

To fix this, I need to prevent the `cursorPointer` style from being applied to the PDF view. A simple way to do this is to add a style override to the `PressableWithoutFeedback` component in `src/components/PDFView/index.tsx`.

